55 0 obj
<</AP<</N 2293 0 R >>/BS<</S/S/W 1>>/DA(/Arial 0 Tf 0 0 0 rg)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 0/LS[ 4 0]/M(D:20191016025547-03'00')/P 347 0 R /Rect[ 262.452 681.91199 370.60901 696.91498]/Subtype/Widget/T(Campo de Texto13)/Type/Annot/V(Meio-Orc)>>
